From 61d27cbda4f03cc6d3ded350b638874e497e61ba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rohan Godha <git@rohangodha.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 15:57:59 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(auth): hold back each weekly window's reserve under
 soonest-reset

Under soonest-reset, a credential whose weekly window is into its reserve (3%
by default, or the auth JSON's weekly_reserve_percent) ranks after every
credential outside it until the window is within 4 hours of its reset, so each
account keeps some quota until it would expire unused. A credential at least
99% used is never picked until its reset. Bound sessions move off a reserve
credential while another is outside its reserve. When every candidate is into
its floor, the pick fails with a model cooldown until the soonest reset.
