 	soonestResetProbeHold = 5 * time.Minute
+	// soonestResetReserveFraction of each weekly window is held back until the window is
+	// within soonestResetReserveRelease of its reset, so every account keeps some quota for
+	// its owner until it would expire unused anyway. Reserves are still spent when every
+	// candidate is into its reserve. A credential overrides it with a top-level numeric
